        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A Ceylon curry gets its character from black pepper and lime rather than just chilli; the coconut milk rounds the heat without making the dish sweet. Add the lime juice only at the very end so the brightness stays sharp in the finished dish."}]
